ake it happen, all in an environment of secrecy.\n\nThe story centers on Lev Leps, a backup astronaut candidate, and his new companion, the vampire Irina Ruminescu. As part of a daring new Operation Nosferatu, the Mechtat Program will use Irina as a test subject for various conditions expected in space, and ultimately as part of a manned mission, with Lev overseeing Irina's training as a cosmonaut. For reasons of their own, both dream of going into space.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Space","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Vampire","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Military","rank":63,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aviation","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Work","rank":57,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dystopian","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":18,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Irina: The Vampire Cosmonaut","english":"Irina: The Vampire Cosmonaut","native":"月とライカと吸血姫","romaji":"Tsuki to Laika to Nosferatu","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"月与莱卡与吸血公主"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"月亮和莱卡和吸血姬"}]},"trailer":{"id":"2j-l9SzQdCU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2j-l9SzQdCU/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}